                  {
                     "text" : "LOSE qStroika_Foundation_Memory_NeedPtrStoredInEnableSharedFromThis_",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(see if we ever call sahred_from_this – maybe that’s why no fail?? Maybe leve in and docuemtn better. No matter what – even if I remove – document better what this was for. Note MSFT impl of enabled_shared_from_this aggregagtes a weakptr).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(I think just document – we use a lot – and don’t seem to need – maybe static cast is unsafe in cases of virtual bases*?)",
